     "body": "> trino 473 support hudi 0.15 MOR snapshot views? [@NICK-T-D](https://github.com/NICK-T-D)\n\nAs far as I know, Trino does not support Hudi merge‑on‑read (MOR) snapshot views. For details, see the Hudi documentation here:\n\nhttps://hudi.apache.org/docs/sql_queries/#merge-on-read-tables",
